      "id": "frag-1",
      "focal_uid": 1,
      "title": "How many chips reach the market",
      "insight": "Blackwell output is the supply hinge: it depends on TSMC packaging and HBM memory upstream and lands directly on the price \u2014 ample supply eases it, shortages spike it. Everything supply-side funnels through B200 availability, which is why it sits at the centre of the map.",
