      "focal_uid": 12,
      "title": "A wildcard from Washington and Beijing",
      "insight": "Export restrictions are a root cause \u2014 nothing upstream drives them \u2014 but they reshape where chips can flow, pushing supply into the second-hand market and moving the price. A stroke of policy can tighten or loosen the market overnight.",
